                    </span>

            </div>


    <div>&nbsp;</div>
    <div class="component comp-footnotes" data-component="Footnotes">

                <div class="comp-footnotes__note">
                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote1" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 1"><sup>1</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>Thank you to Jessie Romero for assistance preparing these remarks.&nbsp;</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="comp-footnotes__note">
                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote2" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 2"><sup>2</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>Based on core PCE inflation. </p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="comp-footnotes__note">
                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote3" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 3"><sup>3</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>For example, see Esther George, &ldquo;<a href="https://www.kansascityfed.org/~/media/files/publicat/speeches/2019/econclubofminneapolis2019may13egfinal_gk.pdf">Is Low Inflation a Problem for the United States?</a>&rdquo; Speech at the Economic Club of Minnesota, Minneapolis, Minn., May 14, 2019.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="comp-footnotes__note">
                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote4" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 4"><sup>4</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>For example, see James Bullard, &ldquo;<a href="https://www.stlouisfed.org/on-the-economy/2019/june/bullard-explains-recent-fomc-dissent">President Bullard Explains His Recent FOMC Dissent</a>,&rdquo; June 21, 2019.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="comp-footnotes__note">
                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote5" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 5"><sup>5</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>For example, see John Williams, &ldquo;<a href="https://www.newyorkfed.org/newsevents/speeches/2019/wil190718">Living Life Near the ZLB</a>,&rdquo; Speech at the 2019 Annual Meeting of the Central Bank Research Association, New York City, July 18, 2019.</p></div>
                </div>
    </div>
